{"id":"c64ea85bb5c6c8d4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/092_Robinson_算术_Q.md","title":"092 Robinson 算术 Q","display":"092_Robinson_算术_Q","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-算术语言\">1. 算术语言</h1>\n<p>元层自然数集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>新变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var,\\quad zero,\\quad succ,\\quad add,\\quad mul.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var,\\quad zero,\\quad succ,\\quad add,\\quad mul.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项形成\">2. 项形成</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_Q\">\\(Tm_Q\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_Q\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"zero\\in Tm_Q\">\\(zero\\in Tm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in Tm_Q\">\\(t\\in Tm_Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"succ(t)\\in Tm_Q\">\\(succ(t)\\in Tm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_Q\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"add(s,t)\\in Tm_Q\">\\(add(s,t)\\in Tm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_Q\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_Q\">\\(mul(s,t)\\in Tm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>数码函数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar 0=zero\">\\(\\bar 0=zero\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n)\">\\(\\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,A\">\\(\\forall x\\,A\\)</span> 只是显示记号，不是新的原始构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公式与自由变量\">3. 公式与自由变量</h1>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_Q\">\\(Frm_Q\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_Q\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_Q\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Frm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_Q\">\\(A\\in Frm_Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_Q\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_Q\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_Q\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_Q\">\\(A\\in Frm_Q\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(x,A)\\in Frm_Q\">\\(all(x,A)\\in Frm_Q\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T^Q:Tm_Q\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^Q:Frm_Q\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T^Q:Tm_Q\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^Q:Frm_Q\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本文件中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T\">\\(FV_T\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T^Q\">\\(FV_T^Q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F\">\\(FV_F\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F^Q\">\\(FV_F^Q\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>项自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式自由变量函数满足下列方程：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\n\\quad\nFV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\n\\quad\nFV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^Q:Frm_Q\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^Q:Frm_Q\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^Q(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad\nBV_F^Q(neg(A))=BV_F^Q(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^Q(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad\nBV_F^Q(neg(A))=BV_F^Q(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^Q(imp(A,B))=BV_F^Q(A)\\cup BV_F^Q(B),\n\\quad\nBV_F^Q(all(x,A))=BV_F^Q(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^Q(imp(A,B))=BV_F^Q(A)\\cup BV_F^Q(B),\n\\quad\nBV_F^Q(all(x,A))=BV_F^Q(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-替换与-alpha-等价\">4. 替换与 alpha 等价</h1>\n<p>定义项替换函数与公式替换函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^Q:Tm_Q\\times Var\\times Tm_Q\\to Tm_Q,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^Q:Tm_Q\\times Var\\times Tm_Q\\to Tm_Q,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^Q:Frm_Q\\times Var\\times Tm_Q\\to Frm_Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^Q:Frm_Q\\times Var\\times Tm_Q\\to Frm_Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^Q(t,x,s)\">\\(Sub_T^Q(t,x,s)\\)</span>，记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^Q(A,x,s)\">\\(Sub_F^Q(A,x,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"mul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[mul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[imp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)\">\\(all(y,A)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nall(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nall(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nall(y,A),&amp;y=x,\\\\\nall(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x\\land y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^Q\\subseteq Frm_Q\\times Frm_Q\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^Q\\subseteq Frm_Q\\times Frm_Q\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_Q\">\\(Frm_Q\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(neg(A),neg(B))\\in E\">\\((neg(A),neg(B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\">\\((imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(all(x,A),all(x,B))\\in E\">\\((all(x,A),all(x,B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in Var\">\\(x,y\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式原子只按字面相等进入该兼容闭包。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-逻辑公理与规则\">5. 逻辑公理与规则</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{log}^Q\">\\(Ax_{log}^Q\\)</span> 是以下具名集合的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{log}^Q\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{=2}^Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{log}^Q\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^Q\n\\cup Ax_{=2}^Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_Q\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to1}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_Q\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to2}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_Q\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to2}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_Q\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to3}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_Q\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to3}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_Q\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall1}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_Q,t\\in Tm_Q\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall1}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_Q,t\\in Tm_Q\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall2}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_Q,\\ x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall2}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_Q,\\ x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=1}^Q\n=\n\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_Q\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=1}^Q\n=\n\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_Q\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=2}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_Q,t,u\\in Tm_Q\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=2}^Q\n=\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_Q,t,u\\in Tm_Q\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>推理规则作为带类型的关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^Q\n=\n\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_Q\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\to^Q\n=\n\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_Q\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^Q\n=\n\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_Q,\\ x\\in Var\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\forall^Q\n=\n\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_Q,\\ x\\in Var\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A}{B}\\quad(A\\equiv_\\alpha^Q B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A}{B}\\quad(A\\equiv_\\alpha^Q B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^Q\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_Q,\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^Q B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha^Q\n=\n\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_Q,\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^Q B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-Robinson-Q-公理\">6. Robinson Q 公理</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的非逻辑公理集合定义为下列七个闭公式组成的有限集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nAx_Q^{arith}=\\{\\;&amp;\nall(x,neg(eq(succ(var(x)),zero))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,imp(eq(succ(var(x)),succ(var(y))),eq(var(x),var(y))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,imp(neg(eq(var(x),zero)),neg(all(y,neg(eq(var(x),succ(var(y)))))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(add(var(x),zero),var(x))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(add(var(x),succ(var(y))),succ(add(var(x),var(y)))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(mul(var(x),zero),zero)),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(mul(var(x),succ(var(y))),add(mul(var(x),var(y)),var(x)))))\n\\;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nAx_Q^{arith}=\\{\\;&amp;\nall(x,neg(eq(succ(var(x)),zero))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,imp(eq(succ(var(x)),succ(var(y))),eq(var(x),var(y))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,imp(neg(eq(var(x),zero)),neg(all(y,neg(eq(var(x),succ(var(y)))))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(add(var(x),zero),var(x))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(add(var(x),succ(var(y))),succ(add(var(x),var(y)))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(mul(var(x),zero),zero)),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(mul(var(x),succ(var(y))),add(mul(var(x),var(y)),var(x)))))\n\\;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第三条用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(all(y,neg(eq(var(x),succ(var(y))))))\">\\(neg(all(y,neg(eq(var(x),succ(var(y))))))\\)</span> 表示存在一个前驱。全体公理为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_Q=Ax_{log}^Q\\cup Ax_Q^{arith}\">\\(Ax_Q=Ax_{log}^Q\\cup Ax_Q^{arith}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>为明确目标差异，定义一阶归纳公式族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"IndSch_Q\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=zero],imp(all(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),all(x,A))):A\\in Frm_Q,\\ x\\in Var\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[IndSch_Q\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=zero],imp(all(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),all(x,A))):A\\in Frm_Q,\\ x\\in Var\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Robinson Q 的区分条件是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_Q^{arith}\\subseteq Ax_Q\n\\land\nAx_Q\\cap IndSch_Q=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_Q^{arith}\\subseteq Ax_Q\n\\land\nAx_Q\\cap IndSch_Q=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_Q\n=\n\\bigl(Ax_Q^{arith},\\ IndSch_Q,\\ Ax_Q\\cap IndSch_Q\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_Q\n=\n\\bigl(Ax_Q^{arith},\\ IndSch_Q,\\ Ax_Q\\cap IndSch_Q\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>定义行许可谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_Q\n\\land\n\\pi(i)\\in Frm_Q\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_Q\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_Q\n\\land\n\\pi(i)\\in Frm_Q\n\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_Q\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^Q)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\\n\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^Q)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\\n\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^Q)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^Q)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\n\\land\n\\pi:m\\to Frm_Q\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\n\\land\n\\pi:m\\to Frm_Q\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义末行关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_Q(\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Last}_Q(\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\land \\pi:m\\to Frm_Q\\land \\pi(m-1)=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\land \\pi:m\\to Frm_Q\\land \\pi(m-1)=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_Q A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_Q A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists \\pi\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\land \\operatorname{Last}_Q(\\pi,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists \\pi\\ \\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_Q(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\land \\operatorname{Last}_Q(\\pi,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Thm_Q\n=\n\\{A\\in Frm_Q:\\varnothing\\vdash_Q A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Thm_Q\n=\n\\{A\\in Frm_Q:\\varnothing\\vdash_Q A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_Q,\nFrm_Q,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_F^Q,\nfresh,\nSub_T^Q,\nSub_F^Q,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^Q,\nAx_Q,\nIndSch_Q,\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_Q,\nRule_\\to^Q,\nRule_\\forall^Q,\nRule_\\alpha^Q,\nProof_Q,\n\\operatorname{Last}_Q,\n\\vdash_Q,\nThm_Q,\n\\Delta_Q\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal Q\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_Q,\nFrm_Q,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_F^Q,\nfresh,\nSub_T^Q,\nSub_F^Q,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^Q,\nAx_Q,\nIndSch_Q,\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_Q,\nRule_\\to^Q,\nRule_\\forall^Q,\nRule_\\alpha^Q,\nProof_Q,\n\\operatorname{Last}_Q,\n\\vdash_Q,\nThm_Q,\n\\Delta_Q\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含 Robinson Q 的算术公理和一阶 Hilbert 证明；不含归纳公理、真算术公理或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-算术语言","text":"1. 算术语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-项形成","text":"2. 项形成","level":1},{"id":"3.-公式与自由变量","text":"3. 公式与自由变量","level":1},{"id":"4.-替换与-alpha-等价","text":"4. 替换与 alpha 等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-逻辑公理与规则","text":"5. 逻辑公理与规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-Robinson-Q-公理","text":"6. Robinson Q 公理","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i<n\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,","display":true},{"tex":"fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"var,\\quad zero,\\quad succ,\\quad add,\\quad mul.","display":true},{"tex":"eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.","display":true},{"tex":"Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"zero\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"succ(t)\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"add(s,t)\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar 0=zero","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n+1}=succ(\\bar n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"s\\doteq t","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,A","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_Q","display":fals